  "text": "Let \\(S =\\left\\{ \\theta \\in \\lbrack 0,2\\pi\\rbrack:8^{2\\sin^{2}\\theta}+8^{2\\cos^{2}\\theta}= 16 \\right\\}\\). Then \\(n(S) +\\sum_{\\theta \\in S} \\left( sec\\left( \\frac{\\pi}{4}+ 2\\theta \\right)\\csc\\left( \\frac{\\pi}{4}+ 2\\theta \\right) \\right)\\) is equal to:",
