  "text": "The sum of the solutions \\(x\\in\\mathbb{R}\\) of the equation \\(\\frac{3\\cos2x+\\cos^{3}2x}{\\cos^{6}x-\\sin^{6}x}=x^{3}-x^{2}+ 6\\) is",
