  "solution": "\\(\\cos^6x-\\sin^6x=\\cos2x\\left(1-\\tfrac14\\sin^22x\\right)=\\cos2x\\cdot\\tfrac{3+\\cos^22x}{4}\\); numerator \\(=\\cos2x(3+\\cos^22x)\\). So LHS \\(=4\\). Then \\(x^3-x^2+6=4\\Rightarrow x^3-x^2+2=0\\Rightarrow(x+1)(x^2-2x+2)=0\\). Only real root \\(x=-1\\); sum \\(=-1\\).",
