  "text": "Let the range of the function \\(f(x) =\\frac{1}{2 + \\sin3x + \\cos3x},x \\in IR\\) be \\(\\lbrack a,b\\rbrack\\). If \\(\\alpha\\) and \\(\\beta\\) are respectively the A.M. and the G.M. of \\(a\\) and \\(b\\), then \\(\\frac{\\alpha}{\\beta}\\) is equal to:",
