  "id": "2db372b8-874b-4cef-86c1-7d098bc69c56",
  "text": "If \\(A = \\frac{\\sin 3^{\\circ}}{\\cos 9^{\\circ}} + \\frac{\\sin 9^{\\circ}}{\\cos 27^{\\circ}} + \\frac{\\sin 27^{\\circ}}{\\cos 81^{\\circ}}\\) and \\(B = \\tan81^{\\circ} - \\tan3^{\\circ}\\), then\\(\\frac{B}{A}\\) is equal to \\(\\_\\_\\_\\_\\) .",
